On October 23, 2022, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries and the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia officially inaugurated the export of fresh longan fruit from Cambodia to the Chinese market.
One year ago, the General Department of Agriculture registered 97 companies and plantation factories for export of Cambodian longan to China and 12 plantations and received official approval from the General Administration of Customs. Of the People's Republic of China (GACC).
In addition to exporting to the Chinese market, Cambodian enterprises are processing Cambodian fresh gourds into gourds, gourds, gourds, gourds and gourds, which are sold in supermarkets in the country.
