The statement of the Minister of Education was made on the afternoon of October 27, 2023 in a press conference related to the process of the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination (Bakdup. The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports will organize the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination on November 6, 2023).
"The Ministry of Education will organize the high school diploma exam in accordance with the four principles of the exam: principles of law, justice, transparency and acceptable results," said Deputy Prime Minister Hang Chuon Naron.
According to Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, in order to maintain security, safety, order and order in the examination centers and ensure health for the jury, committees and candidates of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports continue to strengthen close cooperation with a number of ministries and institutions. 6: Ministry of Interior, Ministry of Health, National Gendarmerie, Anti-Corruption Unit, Electricite du Cambodge and the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia.
He added that all disciplines are selected, organized and managed by the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports. Exam subjects are defined for the science class and for the social science class, with seven subjects in each class. There are two types of disciplines: the transcript, the transcript, and the transcript.
Deputy Prime Minister Hang Chuon Naron emphasized that a total of 29,525 judges and committees to participate in the examination process at all stages, including 4,126 from the Ministry level and from the provincial level. 25,399 people.
The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports also called on all candidates to respect the rules of the exam, especially not to hide all kinds of electronic devices or other documents into the examination center or examination room. . Candidates will be automatically disqualified if they are found to have violated the rules and regulations.
It should be informed that the Ministry will post the list of candidates in the capital and provinces twice, the first time on October 30, 2023, so that the candidates can check and find the names in the examination centers and the second time on the 5th. November 2023 to review and confirm the examination center, room number and table number.
