(Phnom Penh): Dr. Eang Sophalleth, Minister of Environment, received Prof. Andre SPIEGEL, Director of the Institut Pasteur du Cambodge, to pay a courtesy call and discuss work to continue cooperation in promoting ecology, animal disease research, food safety and health. Resistant to antibiotics at the Ministry on the afternoon of Thursday, October 26, 2023.
