National Bank of Cambodia Hosts 8th ASEAN Central Bank Internal Audit Committee Meeting
(Siem Reap): The National Bank of Cambodia on October 26, 2023 hosted the 8th Meeting of the Internal Audit Chairs of the Central Bank of ASEAN on "Promoting Governance in an Environment "Change quickly."
The opening ceremony of this meeting was held with the participation of Mr. Sum Sanith, Deputy Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia, held on October 26, 2023 at Sokha Angkor Hotel, Siem Reap.
The 8th ASEAN Central Bank Internal Audit Committee Meeting aims to improve the quality of internal audit in accordance with professional standards to strengthen the effective governance, risk management and internal control system of the Central Bank and provide Opportunity for ASEAN Central Bank Internal Audit Officers to exchange experiences and strengthen cooperation.
Mr. Sum Sanisith also mentioned that improving governance is an important role of the internal auditor in maintaining the effectiveness of governance and strengthening the risk management of the institution.
The meeting was attended by officials from the Department of Internal Audit and senior auditors from 10 ASEAN Central Banks, the Asian Development Bank (ADB) and the Reserve Bank of Australia.
