He stressed that this factor of peace and political stability provides a favorable environment for better economic and social development of Cambodia, as well as conducive to the construction of many physical infrastructure as it is today, all proud.
Mr. Rath Sovannarak reminded Banking and Financial Institutions to continue to pay attention to customer protection as a priority and important work for the institution to ensure the provision of financial services, especially ethical credit. Bio is responsible and takes into account the rights and interests of customers.
