(Beijing): Today is October 25, a day that all Chinese people must remember. On October 25, 1950, the Chinese People's Volunteer Army went to fight in North Korea and brought back the victorious victory, they began the war to help North Korea against the US invasion. Later, this day was designated as the anniversary of this war victory.
On October 19, 1950, the Chinese People's Volunteer Army left their homeland and went to fight in North Korea. This is a very different war between the forces of the warring parties, after two years and nine months of fierce fighting, the Chinese and North Korean armies defeated the United States and forced the aggressors. Signed the ceasefire agreement on July 27, 1953.
Great victory in the war to help North Korea against US aggression demonstrates China's new national power and reveals the "paper tiger" of US imperialism, the Chinese nation's centenary shame Once abused, the era when Western invaders used a few cannons to invade a country has disappeared.
Today, let us remember the 197,653 volunteer heroes who sacrificed their lives on the battlefield to help North Korea resist US aggression, and expect these heroes to be remembered and admired for generations to come. One generation. Today, we salute the Chinese People's Volunteer Army, pay tribute to that great victory!
