(Kampong Cham): Mr. Khlot Phorn, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, this morning, October 26, 2023, chaired a meeting to organize security and order in the “E” boat race, floating lanterns and fireworks. Exhibition in Kampong Cham, which will take place on October 28-29, 2023.
