It should also be reminded that the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration organized the "E" boat race, floated lanterns and lit fireworks in order to preserve the tradition of promoting water sports and create a happy atmosphere for the people under the shadow of peace. The boat race will take place on October 28-29, 2023, with the "E" boat race and international standard boats.
