Interior Ministry spokesman: 53 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on October 25
(Phnom Penh): At least 53 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on October 25, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on October 26, 2023.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 53 suspects, 48 were arrested in 19 criminal cases and five were arrested in six drug offenses.
The Ministry states that the Kingdom of Cambodia is affected by low pressure in the South China Sea. During this time, the high pressure system covering Thailand and the South China Sea diminished. While the southwest and south winds bring moisture from the Gulf of Thailand to the coast, while the east and southeast winds bring moisture from the South China Sea to the north. Cambodia.
On October 30, there will be another high pressure system from China covering the northern part of Thailand extending to the South China Sea. Meanwhile, the wind will change direction from northeast to Cambodia.
