The Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and the Cambodia Securities Exchange have agreed to provide investment identification numbers and make it easier for investors to open securities trading accounts online.
(Phnom Penh): The Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and the Cambodia Securities Exchange on October 25, 2023 signed an agreement on the link between the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia (SEC) online investment identification system and the SEC's online trading account opening system. Cambodia Securities.
"This new achievement not only provides convenience to the public in the country, but also the ability to facilitate and attract foreign investors to the Cambodian market at any time, this is an important turning point in the securities sector," he said.
Mr. Sou Socheat added that the connection was established by combining the Provider Identification System for Securities Companies, the Online Investor Identification System of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and the Securities Exchange Online Online Accounting System. Under the same system.
Mr. Hong Sohour said that the agreement on the provision of online investment identification numbers and the opening of online securities trading accounts will further promote investment in the stock market and welcome all investors who wish to invest and facilitate. Easy to invest to the public anytime, anywhere, whether investors abroad or in the country.
He added that by the end of 2022, the number of account holders will be more than 30,000, and by the end of 2023, there will be more than 10,000 more accounts. In particular, for 2024, we expect to have up to 350,000 account holders as the number of account openings continues to increase, along with the launch of investment identification numbers and the opening of online securities trading accounts. Provides easy and fast, so opening this 3-5 thousand accounts is not difficult.
He said that in particular, the trading volume in the last two months has decreased slightly below $ 200,000 per day on average, while about seven months ago jumped to nearly $ 300,000 per day on average, despite the trend. Declining slightly, but we expect that in the future, trading volume will be able to boost further through the participation of many investors.
