At the same time, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet also confirmed to the workers in Kampong Cham that soon it will be easier to travel faster in Kampong Cham while National Road No. 7 from Skun to Bridge The Kizuna, which is about 45 kilometers long, has already opened two to four lanes to facilitate commuting to the people, and the factory presence has increased.
It should be noted that the Tonle Bassac Navigation Road and Logistics System Project was named "Prek Chik Funan Techo" Project at the Plenary Session of the Council of Ministers of the 6th Legislature of the National Assembly on May 19, 2023. On June 7, 2023, the government decided to establish an inter-ministerial commission to implement the project.
The "Funan Techo Canal" project is designed to expand the potential use of water transport to contribute to the further development of socio-economic activities to a higher level and to provide appropriate solutions on Challenges and obstacles of the water transport sector that we have been facing today.
The project will build three waterway dams, build 11 bridges, build a 208-kilometer sidewalk, and provide navigation assistance and other cross-river infrastructure. The construction of the new waterway project is estimated to cost US $ 1.7 billion and take about four years to complete.
