This training course will be organized nationwide in 4 other technical and training centers for engineers and technical officers of the 25 Departments of Public Works and Transport, including: Siem Reap, Kampong Cham, Kep and Kratie to complete Effective in learning, understanding, disseminating and practicing. Guangxi authorities use strategy to show development to Southeast Asia through journalists
(Guangxi, China): Guangxi is an ancient Chinese civilized province and also an important port province of China, which borders Southeast Asian countries along land and sea borders. Especially in ancient times, the people of Guangxi changed a lot of relations with the people of Southeast Asia and also changed many cultures and customs of each other.
Guangxi also has strong trade, investment and tourism ties with countries in Southeast Asia. The Kovid 19 outbreak, which began in late 2019, has created barriers and barriers to all of this activity.
After the 19 outbreak of Kovid 19 was successfully fought in 2023, the Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region has launched a strategy to promote the development and growth of the tourism industry in the provinces to the world, especially in Southeast Asia. .
The visit of journalists from Southeast Asian countries to Guangxi Province was officially opened this morning, October 25, 2023, with the participation of senior leaders in Guangxi Province.
Liu Khun said that Guangxi always remembers the task given by President Xi Jinping to take responsibility for the brave mission on the basis of favorable location, actively participate in the construction of the Belt and Road Initiative. Work hard for the China-ASEAN Expo, China-ASEAN Business Summit and other major investment and forums.
He expressed the expectation that through this program, more people will get to know Guangxi. He also expressed strong belief that the coverage of ASEAN journalists will be a bridge between Guangxi and the international community.
