(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of October 23, 2023, Mr. Mao Ha Vannal, Minister in Charge of the Secretariat of State for Aviation, led a delegation to brief the Constitutional Council on the draft law on the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation. The ceremony was held in the presence of Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council.
On October 24, 2023, tomorrow, the Constitutional Council will hold a meeting to review the constitutionality of the law on the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation. The meeting will be chaired by Dr. M. Chhun Lim.
It should be noted that the Law on the Establishment of the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation was approved by the National Assembly on October 9, 2023 at the 1st Session of the 7th Legislature and the Senate reviewed and gave full unanimous opinion on the form and concept of the law without modification at the session. The 11th legislature on October 17, 2023.
