(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhay Rithy Sen, Minister of Rural Development, on October 23, 2023, chaired a meeting to review the work results for October and the work direction for November 2023 of the Ministry of Rural Development in the presence of the Permanent Secretary of State. Secretary of State, Undersecretary of State, Director General, Director General of the Department, as well as the directors of the 25 Capital-Provincial Departments of Rural Development, who participated in the ZOOM system.
To contribute to the implementation of this strategy, the Ministry of Rural Development has launched four main programs:
1. Develop physical and transportation infrastructure by striving to improve the quality of roads from red gravel to paved and concrete roads so that people can access public services in all seasons and distribute economic growth to rural areas.
Second, improve the living conditions of rural communities in order to promote 100% water and sanitation coverage by 2030.
Third, diversify rural economic activities by participating in the implementation of the National Strategy on Informal Economy by promoting basic skills training to create jobs and employment in order to increase household economic income in rural areas.
Fourth, strengthen institutions in order to serve the people in rural areas with integrity and high responsibility.
On that occasion, the Minister mentioned the progress of rural water supply and sanitation, which has now reached 80%, and recommended to continue to promote the establishment of more model villages in the existing 30 model villages.
Regarding various issues, the Minister mentioned some of the following work:
Participate in the preparation of lanterns of the Ministry of Rural Development to celebrate the upcoming Water Festival, Ok Ambok, Moon Worship and Floating Lanterns
- Establish a number of committees to be a collective leadership mechanism and coordinate the work of the sector.
- Training work on leading professional officers to strengthen institutions that must be qualified, virtuous and valued officials
The General Departments, Departments, Units and Departments of Rural Development of the Capital and Provinces shall implement the monthly, quarterly, semi-annual work inspection meetings and must also strengthen the internal unity.
