Guangxi is one of China's largest provinces and is geographically located outside ASEAN. The provincial authorities regularly bring in journalists from ASEAN member countries to visit and cover developments in the province.
Cambodian journalists from six units, led by Mr. Chuon Chan Phearun, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Information and Audiovisual of the Ministry of Information, leave Cambodia on the afternoon of October 23, 2023.
Through this program, Cambodian journalists will visit the electric vehicle factory, China's famous natural and cultural tourist sites.
Chuon Chanphearun believes that ASEAN and China media play an important role in promoting the development and cooperation between ASEAN and the Chinese people. He hopes that this visit to Guangxi will strengthen the relationship between Cambodia's major media with Guangxi and other ASEAN countries.
Through this visit to Guangxi, Mr. Phearun expects to learn from the development experience of Guangxi and will take this opportunity to make the media from China and ASEAN more interested in Cambodia. In order to attract Chinese and ASEAN tourists to visit Cambodia.
Commune councilor commits suicide out of frustration over chronic illness
(Svay Rieng): A man known as a member of Thna Thnong commune council, Romduol district, Svay Rieng province, committed suicide due to a chronic illness. The incident was reported by villagers and families to local authorities to examine the body at 12:15 noon on October 22, 2023.
According to the district police, the man named Duong Ra, 51 years old, a member of the commune council living in the above commune village, according to Ouk Nary (the wife of the deceased), said that her husband was ill. I have been sick for many years due to diabetes and high blood pressure.
Police said that after receiving the information, the provincial police immediately cooperated with the district police and the doctor of Bos Mon Health Center to examine the body, concluding that it was indeed a suicide by self-mutilation without any known signs. It's a murder story.
