Watch the documentary video on the Paris Agreement and nation building after this agreement as follows: Mr. Pen Bona: Commemorating the anniversary of the Paris Peace Agreement is a reminder of the role of the Cambodian statesman.
Prior to the negotiations within the framework of the Paris Peace Agreement, there was one of the most important events that all Cambodians will never forget: January 7, 1979, the day of the liberation of the country and the lives of Cambodians from the death of the Khmer Rouge killing field regime. Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a key figure in this historic mission.
When it comes to the Paris Peace Accords, two main characters are mentioned: the great hero, His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk and Samdech Techo Hun Sen (with the support of the international community). Without the dedication and strong commitment of the two actors, the Paris Peace Accords would not have been possible.
After nearly four years of intense negotiations, the Paris Peace Agreement was reached on October 23, 1991, paving the way for the 1993 elections. But after the creation and promulgation of the Constitution and after the withdrawal of UNTAC forces from Cambodia, peace has not yet been found. Khmer Rouge forces continued to control part of Cambodian territory, and insecurity and armed conflict continued.
The character of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who appeared from the beginning in the cause of saving the nation and Khmer life, also continued the mission to find peace for Cambodia until it was completely achieved in 1998 under the policy of "win-win" according to the pure Khmer formula. "Peace has also become a solid foundation for the country's development to this day."
In conclusion, Mr. Pen Bona emphasized that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a character who saves the nation, a character who dares to come and fight for Khmer life from the jaws of the dead, a character who is the father of the founder of peace and a character of the country's development. Unprecedented progress in the last 500 years of history. Therefore, it is certain that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a rare and outstanding statesman of Cambodia in the late 20th and early 21st centuries.
