Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is located in Kriel Pong Village, Popel Commune and Praval Village, Tayek Commune, Sot Nikum District, Siem Reap Province, 40 km from Angkor Wat and 51 km from Siem Reap City.
The international airport has 38 parking terminals and will be able to handle 7 million air passengers a year for 2023 and reach 12 million passengers a year from 2040.
