(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a weather forecast in Cambodia for October 22, 2023.
From October 22 to 25, in some provinces such as Stung Treng, Preah Vihear, Ratanakkiri and Mondulkiri, there will be light to moderate rainfall, covering 30% to 50% of the land area.
In Phnom Penh, the coastal and central lowlands will receive moderate rainfall mixed with thunderstorms with rainfall covering 50% to 60%.
People should be very careful about this situation, which can cause floods.
