The above operation started to dismantle the barricade from 8:30 am to 3:00 pm at Boeung Riel point in Kampong Os commune, Choul Kiri district. As a result, the joint authority dismantled and destroyed and burned the fishing gear on the spot, including 13 long barriers with a length of 2,600 meters, 25 gutters, 1,050 poles, released fish fry. 170 km back into the natural lake as well.
It should be noted that at the above point, on September 25, 2023, the police in Kampong Chhnang province cracked down on economic crimes with 24 people, 6 boats, and already cracked down once, destroying 8 long barricades. 4,000 meters long, swallow 30 mouths and release 800 kg of fish back into the natural lake. But to this day, at the same point above, there is still the crime of placing long barriers, each of which has the same length.
