SEOUL: Yoon Suk Yeol will pay state visits to Saudi Arabia and Qatar from October 21 to 26, 2023, the Office of the President of the Republic of Korea announced on Thursday. Discuss business cooperation, including security issues related to the Israeli-Palestinian conflict. This is according to the release by the AFP news agency on Thursday, October 19, 2023.
Deputy National Security Adviser Kim Tae-hyo told a news conference that South Korea was "deeply concerned" about the rising civilian casualties in the Israeli-Palestinian conflict and would provide assistance for purely humanitarian reasons. Yun will also discuss cooperation with Saudi Arabia and Qatar, focusing on bringing peace to the region and boosting South Korea's national security.
In seed production techniques, it is divided into 5 categories before distributing the seeds to farmers for rice production, including 1st class, alternative plant, 2nd pure seed, 3rd registered variety, 4th licensed rice variety and Fifth, pure breed.
