He stated that the gifts distributed to 200 families in 4 communes in Serei Sophorn City, which received 1 family, include: 15 kg of rice, 2 bottles of plain soy sauce, 3 bottles of fish sauce, 2 bottles of fish, 5 cans of salt, 1 kg Sugar, bean curd, garlic, oil, 1 box of noodles, 1 piece of pure water and some money.
