BEIJING: 2023 marks the 10th anniversary of Chinese President Xi Jinping's initiative to jointly build the "Belt and Road". For the past 10 years, China has adhered to the principle of joint discussion, joint construction and sharing to promote the joint construction of the "Belt and Road" to achieve high-quality development to achieve common goals. .
In terms of mutual investment, from 2013 to 2022, mutual investment between China and the countries along the "Belt and Road" totaled 270 billion US dollars, of which Chinese enterprises have invested. A total of $ 57.13 billion provided 421,000 jobs in relevant countries, a significant contribution to poverty reduction in the region.
Former Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Cambodia's new Prime Minister Hun Manet have praised the "Belt and Road" initiative, which has made an indispensable contribution to Cambodia's prosperity and socio-economic development. As well as strengthening the friendship and cooperation between Cambodia and China to be even closer.
