(Kampong Thom): Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, urged professional officers to solve problems effectively, transparently and quickly. The provincial governor made such a statement at the outreach and consultation forum of the third mandate provincial council 2023 on the morning of October 17, 2023 at Baray district hall.
