(Phnom Penh): As the Chairman of the 5th Review Meeting of the Ottawa Convention for 2024, Senior Minister Ly Thuch, First Deputy Chairman of the Mine Authority, on 16 October 2023, attended the Strategic Preparatory Meeting for Promote the globalization of mine action in EU residences in Cambodia.
