Senior Minister Ly Thuch said that in particular, as Cambodia hosts the 5th Review Conference or the Summit on the Mine-Free World of the Ottawa Convention for 2024, Cambodia is ready to raise the agenda and action plan. Four priorities to discuss include:
First: Promoting the implementation of the Ottawa Convention; Second, promoting demining for a landmine-free world; Third, promoting South-South partnership and cooperation; and fourth, rescuing people with disabilities. Landmine victims and disabled people with disabilities.
