Articles and pictures by Cambodia-China Friendship Radio Chinese Foreign Ministry: The international community should play a real role in warming up the situation between Palestine and Israel
Wang Wenbin said that the Chinese side is deeply saddened by the escalation of the current Palestinian-Israeli conflict, which has left many innocent civilians dead and deeply concerned. The deteriorating security and humanitarian situation in Palestine, as well as the escalation of the conflict, has seriously affected peace and stability in the region.
Wang Wenbin said the main task now is to immediately cease fire to protect civilians and provide timely humanitarian assistance to the Palestinian people. The key to breaking the vicious cycle of the Palestinian-Israeli conflict is to return to the basics of the "two-state solution" and resume peace talks and establish an independent Palestinian state to achieve peaceful coexistence between the two countries. Palestine and Israel.
Wang Wenbin noted that the Chinese side will continue to maintain communication with all parties concerned to actively promote peace talks and work with regional countries and the international community to play a constructive role in promoting a comprehensive solution to the Palestinian issue. Corner, fair and long lasting.
