(Kandal): Heng Sophearith, Director of Kandal Provincial Fisheries Administration, said that fish production for Kandal province in 2023 may increase as he expected, as illegal fishing offenses are not as common as in the past. Go because the people have a lot of cooperation after the authorities educate and explain the legal procedures to the local.
