According to Mr. Heng Sophearith, after disseminating and educating some people, they also decided to hand over the illegal equipment to the authorities to be destroyed, while those who have volunteered and cooperated with the authorities now He will be released from prison, but if anyone continues to resist and continue to steal illegal gear and fish illegally, from now on, the Central Fisheries Department will not pardon them.
