Considering these challenges, the Ministry of Health calls on the following public:
Citizens must not believe in unreasonable propaganda without clear sources, especially all forms of advertising without permission from the Ministry of Health.
People should not buy pharmaceutical products for sale online without permission from the Ministry of Health, because the sale of health products online is illegal and they can not guarantee the quality and safety that can cause harm. Serious to the health of the people.
* For traders doing traditional medicine products, traditional medicine products, health supplements, cosmetics or preventive medicine products, must adhere to the law consistently and honestly, all advertisements, distributions or sales of these products must have a valid ID or visa or identification number (NOTIFICATION). ) And all advertisements of these products in all forms must be approved by the Ministry of Health.
