The mainstay of the Anti-Corruption Law, which was highlighted by Mr. Neth Pheaktra, is to strengthen the cleanliness of the institution, strengthen the efficiency of the institution and the quality of work of the Ministry of Information. The Ministry of Information, according to the Minister, has played an important role in managing the information sector and as the public relations body of the Royal Government.
