Regarding the general situation around the commune voter registration process, Mr. Duch Son said that during the past 10 days, due to the end of the rainy season, there were heavy rains in the first few days of the initial registration period. Some communes are flooded and the condition of computer equipment for voter registration is old, leading to some inconvenience, but the NEC has taken measures to solve in time.
