On the other hand, in this festival, it is held to spread the devotion to the spirits, relatives and relatives of the seven clans, as well as many great relatives, through the power of the monks who live and suffer as ghosts. There is a prisoner who is severely punished, suffers from hunger, and all of them are free from hardships and sorrows.
