(Kratie): The Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation of Kratie Province this morning, October 10, 2023, celebrated the 25th Cambodian and International Day of the Elderly, October 1, 2023 under the theme "Helping the Elderly Help us all. ”
The ceremony was presided over by Ms. Kham Sopheap, Deputy Governor of Kratie Province and was attended by the Deputy Director of the Department around the province, district governors and 328 elderly people at the Kratie Provincial Theater.
Mr. Chan Sokun, Director of the Provincial Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Fitness, confirmed that the Kratie Provincial Sub-Committee for the Elderly has established old people's associations in 42 communes and 5 communes in Kratie province. In that, 16 communes and 1 commune were operated. The remaining 26 communes and 4 communes are not yet operational.
