(Kratie): Mr. Loek Sothear, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Agriculture, and Mr. Kong Kimny, Deputy Governor of Kratie Province and Director of the Secretariat of Kratie Provincial Disaster Management Committee, distributed rice seeds as a government gift to the people on the morning of October 10, 2023. 400 families affected by floods in Chhlong district, Kratie province for crop rehabilitation.
