The contribution to help build this school building is aimed at filling the shortage of school buildings for students in this remote area after Mr. Prum Sokha, the Minister of Public Works and the team arrived here at the end of 2020, then the village Well, this has not yet been established as an official village for administrative administration.
Regarding the construction of this school building, the Senior Minister urged all the workers who are working on the construction of this school building to pay attention to the construction with high responsibility, both technical standards, good quality and strong according to the technical standards. Properly before and after the official launch in the coming days.
Please be informed that a school building in this good village held a groundbreaking ceremony for construction in July, with a construction period of 6 months, which is scheduled to be completed in February 2024, and the construction is in accordance with high school standards. Preah Sisowath, Phnom Penh, which has to pay for the construction of a total of eighty five thousand US dollars.
