Key Remarks by Samdech Hun Sen President on the Official Launch of the National Strategy on Informal Economic Development 2023-2028
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Tuesday, October 10, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the official launch of National Strategy for Informal Economic Development 2023-2028. This event is held at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh.
"Informal economy" means a system of trade or exchange of goods and services that is not required by law to be registered. The informal economy provides job creation, employment and income, but can have consequences for environmental management, food safety, tax collection, and so on.
On that occasion, His Excellency Hun Manet delivered a speech for about 40 minutes, the following are the main contents:
* Samdech Hun Manet mourns with the families of Cambodian students who lost their lives in the fighting between Israel and Hamas.
* President Hun Manet has declared that the safety of students and the people of Israel is a top priority for the Royal Government.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that both the economy inside and outside the system are Cambodians, which requires the Royal Government to pay high attention.
* President Hun Manet stated that 454 students and citizens of Israel, including 323 evacuated to safety and more than 100 have not been sent to safety.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet National Strategy for Informal Economic Development 2023-2028 will focus on people's livelihood.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the "National Strategy for Informal Economic Development 2023-2028" is an arrow strategy that can shoot three animals. The three animals are: reducing poverty and social inequality, strengthening economic resilience and economic growth.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the strategic theory is good, but the actual results are important.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the "National Strategy for Informal Economic Development 2023-2028" does not force people to register, but encourages them to participate so that the Royal Government can clearly manage the data and assign tasks. Interventions were quick and effective.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the business registration of small and medium enterprises is a win-win strategy, that is, win the state, win the business owner and the nation win.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed relevant ministries and institutions to make efforts to successfully implement the "National Strategy on Informal Economic Development 2023-2028".
