This point was claimed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen as a message to all opposition groups, which in the past assessed that "Samdech does not dare to step down." Samdech considered that those groups knew too little about Samdech, which should have learned more from Samdech, and Samdech lived for at least another 30 years.
