At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander-in-Chief of the Bodyguards for arranging the filming of Son Under the Moonlight and thanked Mr. Fay Sam Ang. And Mr. Heng Long, who directed the filming of a song related to Samdech's life.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also said that all 99 episodes of "Son Under the Full Moon" have been screened and some episodes have been re-recorded.
Please be informed that the movie "Son under the Moonlight", which is a historical film and reflects the life of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen in the cause of the motherland, has been completed. .
The historical film was selected by the production team of 103 main actors, at least 500 people and 500 other forces to perform in the big scenes.
The film "Son under the full moon" shows the life story of Samdech Techo from his childhood, having to leave his parents and siblings in his hometown to study in Phnom Penh, living with the monks in the pagoda Neak Voan.
The film, which is related to this national historical event, cost about $ 6 million to produce. The budget for the film is not the national budget.
