* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech, the president of the ruling party, still has political power.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech does not have the right to command forces, but Samdech has the power to manage various tasks.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has changed from a pagoda boy to the Minister of Foreign Affairs and the Prime Minister. At this time, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet has turned from a traitor to the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen responded to the speaker of the character of his speech that now the speech of Samdech President Hun Manet has a commanding character.
