(Banteay Meanchey): Three teenage girls, while the water was rising and flowing from Thailand, suddenly asked their grandmother to find snails and crabs to cook, but unfortunately slipped and fell into a deep ditch, causing two others to drown. Swim to help because the drowning man hugged both of them and drowned the three of them in despair. The parents only hugged the crying child and almost had a heart attack.
The incident happened at 5:30 pm on October 7, 2023 at a point in a rice field canal in Mak Horn village, Kob commune, O'Chrov district, Banteay Meanchey province.
Authorities confirmed that prior to the incident, according to the description of Van Soth, a 69-year-old female resident of Mak Horn village, Kob commune, O'Chrov district, Banteay Meanchey province, the victim's grandmother said that at about 4 pm. The grandchildren asked him to visit the water and catch snails and crabs to cook.
At that time, she allowed them to go. When they reached the scene, they went down to the snail-shaped crab for several hours. Suddenly, one of them fell into a deep water hole and two others swam to help because the corpse was hugged. Both of them could not move, causing all three to drown at once.
When it was more than 5 o'clock and the three grandchildren could not be seen coming home, the grandmother asked the villagers, the police and the police to go and search for people. All three were taken away and taken home by boat to hand over their bodies to their mothers.
After receiving the child's body, the parents cried and hugged the child almost fainted and described with tears that the child tried to raise from childhood to adulthood, love almost swallowed when the child died in such a panic that he could not control himself.
