Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum announces the appointment of Deputy Prime Minister Neth Savoeun as Chairman of the CPP Working Group in Kampong Cham Province
The ceremony was held at the headquarters of the Cambodian People's Party in Kampong Cham, with the participation of the Vice Chairman of the Provincial Working Group, the Chairman of the District Working Group, and many members of the Cambodian People's Party.
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum took the opportunity to thank the Party Committee at all levels, Party members, civil servants, the Armed Forces and the people of Kampong Cham Province for their hard work, strength, wisdom and The personal resources force has achieved great achievements in the past, which makes the province of Kampong Cham, both in the city and in the countryside, to be proud of the continuous progress.
