He would also like to take this opportunity to express his deep gratitude and generosity to Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, President of the Party and all the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party who have entrusted him to lead the working group. Visited Kampong Cham province. He considered the appointment a great honor, as well as an important task of the party, which he must strive to achieve.
On behalf of the newly appointed Chairman of the Provincial Party Working Group, Dr. Neth Savoeun expressed his strong commitment to sacrifice his strength, mind, intellect and high responsibility as follows:
* 1: Continue to maintain political stability, security, public order and social security in Kampong Cham province as a whole.
* 2: Strengthen party organization by considering meritocracy, ability and popularity
* 3: Collaborate with provincial and local parties to build, strengthen and expand party members from the top to the bottom and identify past popular party members as good role models for new members.
* 4: Promote the development of all infrastructure and improve the livelihood of the people by taking refuge under the shadow of peace and the policy of safe villages, communes and sangkats.
* 5: Jointly address requests, challenges and promote the provision of prompt public services to local people in accordance with the policy of the Cambodian People's Party
* 6: Commitment to victory in the 5th Senate election and the upcoming general election in accordance with the strategic plan of the Central Committee.
* 7: Strengthen the internal unity within the working group with all parties at the local level, strengthen the vision, position, activities and working methods as the main factors to achieve better success. With the people and make the people warm
