The Ministry of Health issued a message congratulating the World Eye Health Day 2023 under the theme "Love your eyes while working"
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Health on October 7, 2023 issued a message to celebrate the World Eye Health Day 2023 under the theme "Love your eyes while working" which will be held on Thursday, the 12th of this month. October 2023 to increase awareness of the importance of eye care and protection.
