The King will open the 37th session of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy on October 9
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of October 9, 2023, the Supreme Council of the Magistracy will hold its 37th session at the Royal Palace under the highest presidency of His Majesty the King of Life, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The highest honor, the President of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy, to review, decide and consult on seven agendas.
In a press release issued by the General Secretariat of the Supreme Council of the Magistracy received by Fresh News on October 7, 2023, the meeting will consider, decide and consult on the following agenda:
Agenda 1: Review and decide on the appointment of the President of the Supreme Court and the decision on the transfer of the appointment of the President, the Vice President and some judges.
Agenda 2: Consult on the request to transfer and appoint some prosecutors and deputy prosecutors at the request of the Minister of Justice.
Agenda 3: Examine and decide on the request for unpaid leave for 2 years of 1 judge of Tbong Khmum Appeal Court.
Agenda 4: Review and decide on the application to return to the original unit of HE Ith Samphors, former Deputy President of the Court of Appeal of Sihanoukville.
Agenda 5: Examine and decide on the request for confirmation within the judiciary for 40 interns.
Agenda 6: Consultation on the request of the Deputy Prosecutor for 16 interns at the request of the Minister of Justice.
