(Phnom Penh): Hatta Bank on October 6, 2023 issued a statement stating that about 10 families living in Prek Ambel commune, Saang district, who suffered from fraud by Run Dara, a former employee. Not affiliated with the bank.
Hattha Bank's statement confirmed that Hatta Bank recently received information that about 10 families living in Prek Ambel commune, Saang district, Kandal province were victims of fraud by a person named Run. Dara, a former employee of Hattha Bank, by mobilizing people to invest with him, giving a return of 10% of the total amount of money that the victim invested with him.
Hattha Bank stated that the above case is a purely personal matter, it is beyond the jurisdiction of Hattha Bank and only the competent authorities can resolve the above matter to the victims.
Hattha Bank will fully cooperate to support the competent authorities in monitoring and investigating this issue to the victims.
