A senior official of the Ministry of Posts led a delegation to the 4th Extraordinary General Assembly of the Global Postal Union of Saudi Arabia
(Saudi Arabia): Mr. Pa Vong Vichet, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications (MPT), from October 1 to 5, 2023, led a delegation to the 4th Extraordinary General Assembly of the Global Postal Union. Riyadh, Saudi Arabia.
The Extraordinary General Assembly was attended by leaders of member countries and national and private postal operators from 192 countries.
On the occasion of the Extraordinary General Assembly, one of the main topics discussed was to increase cooperation with all parties to expand the postal sector (WPSPs), including private companies and partner organizations outside the Global Postal Union network. (UPU), in particular, the use of digital aids to ensure efficient, universal services.
At the same time, member countries are also looking at ways to develop postal financial services. The proposal calls for solutions to the challenges of rapid market change and to expand the role of the postal sector in boosting the global financial environment for the more than one billion non-service people. Bank.
Meanwhile, the UPU also held the 2023 Strategic Summit on the occasion of the General Assembly, in the presence of senior leaders such as: Ministers, Chiefs of Post Regulators and Postal Managers to discuss "People, Objectives and Progress: Chapter New for the postal sector.
During the meeting, Mr. Pa Vong Vichet and Mr. Takeuchi expressed their pleasure at the joint issuance of postage stamps to celebrate the 70th anniversary of Cambodia-Japan cooperation and Japan's contribution to development. The postal sector in Cambodia.
The Universal Postal Union (UPU) was established in 1874 and currently has 192 members. The Union acts as a platform for cooperation between all actors in the postal sector, ensuring a global network for postal products and services through its role as a consultant, coordinator, communications and technical assistance provider.
The union has also set regulations to exchange deposits and made recommendations for boosting the volume of deposits and financial postal services, as well as improving the quality of services for consumers. Ministry of Water Resources announces weather condition in Cambodia for October 6, 2023, rainfall will decrease
