The Minister of Labor and the Federation of Employers and the Cambodian Business Association agreed to strengthen the technical capacity of employees
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Heng Sour, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, on October 4, 2023, met with a delegation of the Federation of Employers and the Cambodian Business Association led by Mr. Oknha Sok Piseth at the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training. .
First of all, the delegation of the Federation of Employers and the Cambodian Business Association congratulated Mr. Heng Sour on his appointment as the Minister of Labor and Vocational Training in the seventh mandate. During the cordial meeting, the two sides agreed to strengthen technical training for factory workers to increase productivity and better working conditions.
In addition, the Minister further urged the private sector to continue to strengthen the implementation of the training of apprentices and interns in order to link theory with direct skills in order to respond more effectively to the needs of the competitive market.
At the same time, the Minister urged the private sector to continue to fully implement its social security obligations in the areas of occupational accidents and health care and pensions, taking into account workers.
In frank discussions, the two sides agreed to promote cooperation and mutual support for a more favorable investment environment as well as better industrial relations in factories.
