Samdech Preah Odom Chakriya Dr. Chheng Bun Chhea always pays attention to the well-being of the people, the well-being of the monks and always encourages to contribute to the development of Buddhism and especially to alleviate the hardships of the monks. In the pagoda.
Please be informed that on the occasion of Pchum Ben Festival every year, Samdech Moha National Assembly President Khuon Sodary always holds the 7th Kan Ben Ceremony at Wat Vimean Techea to dedicate to the soul of the patriarch, patriotic hero, ancestor who Died and prayed for the people and the nation to be happy and prosperous forever.
