"So now is the historic opportunity for me as a health officer to be very happy," he said. The people are also happy to receive the vaccine against cervical disease starting from a 9-year-old girl. This prophylaxis class has a lifetime benefit: a single injection (1 dose) now protects against up to 90% of cervical cancer in a lifetime.
