(Kampong Speu): Deputy Prime Minister Say Samnal, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, has introduced measures to promote systematic land registration throughout the country.
In response to this instruction, the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction of Kampong Speu Province has organized a working group and recruited volunteers to complete the two-year registration period (2024-2025) by establishing a total of 22 registration working groups. .
Kampong Speu Land Registration Team of 12 groups equal to 192 people, divided into 66 framework officers, 8 department contract officers, 118 volunteer officers.
