(Kratie): Mrs. Kham Sopheap, Deputy Governor of Kratie Province, on the morning of October 5, 2023, announced the introduction of cervical cancer vaccination and cervical cancer vaccination to 9-year-old female students. Charge at Rokar Kandal Primary School, Sangkat Rokar Kandal, Kratie City.
According to the World Health Organization 2020 report, a total of 1,135 (11.4%) cases of cervical cancer were diagnosed and 643 cases were fatal, according to a scientific study. According to the World Health Organization, a single dose of cervical cancer vaccine is 80 to 90% effective in reducing infection and preventing cervical cancer.
