(Kandal): Mr. Nuth Puth Dara, Deputy Governor of Kandal Province, urged the administration of Arey Ksat Municipality and all Sangkat Chiefs in Arey Ksat City to jointly resolve to achieve the city to end the high level defecation (ODF +) in the near future. This.
