He reminded that although Kandal province has already won ODF, the provision of equitable and sustainable water supply and sanitation services to rural people is a vision of the National Strategic Plan on Water Supply. Rural cleanliness and hygiene is the goal that the Provincial Department of Rural Development as well as the Kandal Provincial Administration wants to achieve by 2025 to improve the health and livelihood of the people.
