He said that the implementation of the Guidelines on Smoke-Free Tourism Cities is another new step where cities, districts and Khans have more opportunities to participate in the development of tourism as well as build their local reputation in the hearts of tourists. As a "smoke-free tourist city" provides comfort and well-being.
