(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, October 5, 2023, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the celebration of the 26th Teachers' Day.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet expressed his pleasure to be invited to celebrate the Teachers' Day on October 5.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet expressed his appreciation for the high school students' innovative ideas for creating technology tools and compiling books.
* Samdech Thep Dey Hun Manet stated that the development of technology tools and book compilation of high school students shows the positive development in the education sector in Cambodia.
Samdech Hun Sen Manet expressed his support for the education reform program from 2023 to 2028.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that think big, make small, think in all angles, but in practice, you must choose the key and apply it correctly and effectively.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that if you want good students, you must pay attention to education from kindergarten to 12th grade.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that for a good school, it is important to rely on principals and teachers. The principal is like the parents of the school.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that the new legislature focuses on strengthening rather than expanding.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised the provincial leaders to pay close attention to the selection of school principals and health center directors.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that Samdech's ambition is to make all public schools in general knowledge must be acceptable.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that it is necessary to use the available resources to strengthen education without waiting for the establishment of a new generation of schools for all schools.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that Cambodian children are not sure that they will lose to Singaporean or American children, it is important to provide training.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet has decided to pay the salaries of all student teachers based on the total salary multiplied by 70%.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that do not be afraid to invest in creating human resources for the nation.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government will prepare to compile historical documents from the first century for Cambodian children to study.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that do not recruit new ones if they already exist. It is better to save money and give encouragement to old officials.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia now has more officers than soldiers.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that the remaining $ 200 million just suspended some projects.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet wants two days a week for students to participate in social work.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised the school to buy experimental equipment made by Cambodian students.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed schools to pay attention to food that can affect students' health.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that parents and teachers need to establish a relationship with each other to monitor their children's education.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed the expectation that if the implementation of the reform rules set by the Royal Government in the next 10 years is strictly followed, public schools will be more modern and better student discipline.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet announces the introduction of model school standards to strengthen the quality of education and improve student behavior.
