This cultural event aims to preserve, protect and promote the Chapey Dang Veng art form, which is an invaluable national cultural heritage, and lasts for 3 days from October 2 to 4, 2023. In the presence of a group of Chapey Dang Veng artists from the capitals and provinces, they applied to participate in the competition.
