Three twins whose mother died after giving birth in Chbar Morn received gifts from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit (Video inside) (Kampong Speu): Three twins whose mother died immediately after giving birth in Chbar Morn Kampong Speu received donations from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Chairman of the King's Personal Advisory Council, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen.
The gift of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit was handed over by Mr. Seng Teang, Deputy Director of the Cabinet of Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, to the families of the three twin girls at their home in Chbar Morn City, Kampong Speu Province on the morning of the 4th. This October 2023.
The three twin girls who received the sponsorship from Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, the third child, were born on October 2, 2023, to a father named Ey Sok Choeun, a mother named Phon Sophon, 39 years old, a teacher. Due to the mother's illness, the triplets died on October 2, 2023.
In front of the family of three twins, Mr. Seng Teang brought a message of greetings and condolences from Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to Mr. Ey Sok Choeun who lost his beloved wife due to Physical illness. At the same time, he instructed the father of twins to take care of these three twins and their five children for a prosperous future.
Mr. Seng Teang said that from 1999 to the present, more than 24 years ago, 406 families gave birth to triplets or four twins and received generous donations from Samdech. Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit in supporting the hardships in daily life, especially raising three twin babies, must be Samdech's grandchildren when they give birth.
Mr. Seng added that these donations were not donations from the Royal Government, donations from the Cambodian Red Cross or donations from political parties, but rather gifts from the heart. Chreach Thla, with the high consideration of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, who has realized the real difficulties for people who have given birth to three or four twin babies.
The generous gift of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, which was handed over to the family of three twins in Romlong Prakhleh village, Sangkat Sopor Tep, Chbar Morn city, Kampong Speu province, including 5 million Riel, 50 kg of rice, 2 boxes of milk, sugar 5 kg, 2 sarongs and 2 scarves and another 5 million riels for the funeral of the mother of twins.
