The National Bank of Cambodia has said that in order to stabilize the exchange rate, it has prepared a number of measures, including exchange market intervention and the use of other monetary policy instruments to maintain the value of the riel in order to maintain the purchasing power of the people. Cambodia to be stable.
The National Bank of Cambodia announced the start of the first dollar auction on September 4, 2023, when the exchange rate of the riel against the dollar was 1 dollar equal to 4,159 riel, but as of October 4, 2023, after the intervention, the value of the riel against the dollar is 1 dollar equal to 4,126 riel. This is according to the National Bank of Cambodia.
Regarding the issuance of the dollar to buy the riel, Oknha Huot Ieng Tong, President and CEO of Hatta Bank, further explained that the issuance of the dollar to buy the riel is to stabilize the exchange rate, because when the exchange rate is Stable and help the economy a lot.
The tycoon explained, "As we all know, one dollar equals 4,000 riel, so if the dollar is allowed to increase by 5,000 riel per dollar, the purchase price will be higher because the goods They are sold on the market according to the exchange rate. "So what the National Bank of Cambodia needs to do is prevent the exchange rate from rising, for stabilizing interest rates is really important."
The tycoon added that, in fact, Hetha Bank has always been very involved in promoting the use of the riel more widely, including providing loans in riel to customers about 13 percent as of September 2023.
