In a letter sent by the Ministry of Information to Fresh News on the night of October 3, 2023, Mr. Pheng Vannak apologized to the Ministry of Information and the professional journalists. At the same time, Mr. Pheng Vannak requested the Minister of Information to take strict action against individuals who use journalists' cards, especially journalists for unprofessional use.
