These unions, including the National Assembly of the Cambodian National Confederation of Trade Unions, the Cambodian Workers 'Rights Union and the Employers' Association in the garment and textile and travel products sector, have received strong support from the Royal Government of Cambodia for a $ 204 wage increase. With Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet as the head.
