(Jakarta, Indonesia): On the morning of Monday, October 2, 2023, at the ASEAN Secretariat in Jakarta, the Republic of Indonesia, Marko Ham, the newly appointed Ambassador of the Slovenian Republic to ASEAN, presented his credentials to Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN.
The two sides stressed the importance of bilateral cooperation between ASEAN and Slovenia in areas of mutual interest, as well as under the Action Plan to Implement the ASEAN-EU Strategic Partnership 2023-2027.
The two sides exchanged views on ways and means to strengthen the ASEAN-UK Dialogue Partnership and discussed preparations for the ASEAN Secretary-General's working visit to the UK in November.
On Monday afternoon, the ASEAN Secretary-General presented the September Awards to outstanding staff of the ASEAN Secretariat. Please be informed that this program is an initiative of HE Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary General.
