(Phnom Penh): Brigadier General Lev Van Phuong, Director of the Vietnamese Ministry of Police in Cambodia, briefed Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior Abhisit Bandit Sar Sokha on his commitment to further strengthen cooperation with relevant units under the Ministry of Interior. The spirit of annual cooperation between the Ministry of Interior of Cambodia and the Ministry of Police of Vietnam.
