On this occasion, Brigadier General, President of the Representative and the delegation expressed their congratulations and respect for His Excellency Mr. Abhisandibandit, who was elected by the National Assembly as the Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior by the President of the Representative. Express confidence that the Ministry of Interior will continue to achieve even greater achievements.
