(Phnom Penh): The Federation of Trade Unions of Cambodia has issued a petition in support of raising the minimum wage for workers in the textile, garment, footwear and travel products and bags for 2024 to $ 204 per month.
In a supportive petition received by Fresh News on October 2, 2023, the Federation of Cambodian Trade Unions stated that it, on behalf of workers who are members in factories / enterprises across the country, has been closely monitoring The process of negotiating the minimum wage of the National Wage Council, a tripartite mechanism from the first meeting until September 28, 2023.
