(Pursat): A house next to the delta of Pursat River was submerged in the river due to a landslide on the river bank at 15:15 on October 1, 2023 at Prek Sangkat Lolok Sor, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
Sources from the owner of the house said that before the incident, they were sitting in the house, heard the sound several times and the house was shaking, they immediately ran outside and suddenly saw the ground below. The house next to the river bank gradually collapsed, and soon after, the house collapsed into the river.
The source added that due to the immediate incident, they were not able to collect much of the necessary items and materials, taking only some materials and items. At the same time, the materials that flooded the river were recovered by the people, such as: beds, tables, cabinets, chairs.
After the incident, it was observed that Mr. Khoy Rida, Governor of Pursat Province and Chairman of the Provincial Disaster Management Committee arrived at the above location to help the people.
