During the ceremony, candles, incense and flowers were offered to the Preah Rattanatray Samathan Sil, worship was performed, and a variety of food, drinks, fruits, and cakes were brought to the monks to dedicate to the monks. To the ancestral spirits, there are parents, grandparents, relatives of the seven clans.
This Kan Ben ceremony is a big national festival to be held from the 1st of Roach to the 15th of Roach Kheap, the date which is supposed to be the day of Pchum Ben to dedicate to the souls of the elite warriors. Sacrificing one's life for the cause of liberating the nation and its people from the old and new colonial regimes and from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
