(Kampong Chhnang): Two families with more than 20 members who have been suffering from land disputes for more than 20 years with Kampong Chhnang Provincial Forestry Administration once again appealed to the leaders and relevant ministries to help provide justice. They are the real victims for many years.
The above two families include:
Not only that, Mr. Sin Kosal filed a lawsuit against the two families in March 2017 (for encroaching on the land of the tree planting station), but this case was not handled by the court due to the Forestry Administration. The plaintiffs do not have any documents to place the burden on the above two families.
In the past, they also asked the commune, district and provincial authorities and relevant institutions to help solve them since 2011. In particular, during June 2023, Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Governor of Kampong Chhnang, also wrote a note on the application for settlement of land disputes. Of O Rong village chief and Mrs. Ny Salik, the land owner.
