Please be informed that Pchum Ben Festival is one of the big festivals that Cambodians celebrate every year. Pchum Ben Festival is always celebrated for 15 days from the 1st of Roach Kheap to On the 15th of Roach, the festival is considered to be a ceremony to honor the dead and to dedicate the result to the ancestors who have passed away to receive and be free from all sins.
