This introduction was made on September 29, 2023 on the occasion of the celebration of World Tourism Day 2023 under the theme "Tourism and Green Investment" at Samdech Sangka Reach Chuon Nath Park.
Mr. Vy Samnang said that in the past, in some resorts, there was always a lot of criticism and reaction from tourists when they were sold by unscrupulous food vendors and the prices were too high. This made the guests upset and gave up the idea to visit again, not only posted criticism and sharing on social media, disrupting the project to entertain other guests.
