(Phnom Penh): Investigating Judge Sar Samnang of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on September 28, 2023, ordered the detention of a young woman in the Phnom Penh Municipal Prison (PJ) in connection with a case of gang violence against a woman.
The detention order states that Kruy Srey Leap, a resident of a rented house on Concrete Road, Tnot Chrum Village, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 2, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh, was remanded in custody on charges of "intentional violence" with aggravating circumstances. According to Article 218 of the Penal Code, the accomplices are still under the control of the authorities.
A video of the violence was shared on Facebook last week, showing a woman being beaten by a group of women at a guesthouse in the district. Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
After receiving this video, Major General Chuon Narin, Deputy Commissioner General and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner, immediately ordered a specialized search force. After receiving orders from the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner's Office of Minor Crimes, led by Lt. Col. Bun Satya, Deputy Commissioner for Planning, and Brigadier General Ly Bun Eng, Deputy Commissioner in charge of the Minor Criminal Police Office, conducted a series of investigations.
Authorities described that on September 12, 2023, there was a case of intentional violence with aggravated assault, beating and kicking the victim with his hands and feet, causing injuries all over his body and abdomen. Guesthouse 342, Street 271, Village 5, Sangkat Stung Meanchey 2, Khan Meanchey, caused by four suspects named Kruy Srey Leap, Srey Ly, Srey Ra and Srey You.
On September 05, 2023, the victim, Yen Sonita, and seven friends rented a guesthouse room at the scene, Room 204, Room 205, 2nd floor, staying together until the 12th. In September 2023, the victim and the suspect rented two more rooms, Room 211 and Room 208, for a total of four rooms, after which the victim went down to buy six cans of beer to have a drink.
After the action, they kicked the victim with their hands and feet and then went back to sleep in the room. As for Pich, he did not know anything and did not participate in the above activities.
