Samdech Prime Minister stated that while Samdech and his delegation inspected the booth of Cambodian products in Nanning, China on the occasion of attending the 20th ASEAN-China Expo on September 17, Samdech recently met With a young woman who is a representative of a natural stone business in Cambodia, she then asked the Royal Government of Cambodia to consider the possibility of providing additional assistance to the natural stone business in Cambodia.
