(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) informs the Cambodian people about the examination of the 2023 voter list and registration from October 1 to 19, 2023 at Commune / Sangkat halls and in some villages in communes / sangkats across the country.
The 2023 Voter List and Voter Review aims to ensure that the voter list is complete, accurate and secure through:
* Extracting and deleting the names of voters: - who have died - who have been temporarily deprived of the right to vote - who have moved to another commune / sangkat with valid and clear documents to be removed from the voter list
Khmer citizens who have the right to vote and have not yet registered to vote before - Khmer citizens who are 18 years old or older (born before or born on January 1, 2006) - Khmer people who have moved Or the place of residence in the new commune / sangkat must go to register to vote in the commune / sangkat where the person concerned is living or residing.
