Minister Chhay Bithisen Chairs a Meeting on Proclamation on the Establishment of the Steering Committee for National Rural Development Policy 2025-2035
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of September 28, 2023, Mr. Chhay Puthisen, Minister of Rural Development, chaired a meeting to announce the decision on the establishment of the National Rural Development Policy Steering Committee.
Also present were the Secretary of State, Undersecretary of State, Director General of Administration and Finance, Director General of Technology and professional officers of the Ministry of Rural Development.
After reading the decision on the establishment of the Steering Committee for National Policy for Rural Development 2025-2035 with 11 members, the Minister provided the following five main principles and recommendations:
* First, to continue to review, prepare and finalize the draft of the National Policy for Rural Development 2025-2035, which was drafted about 90% in the last 6th mandate.
* Second: Prepare this policy in accordance with the form of law, party political program, in accordance with the first phase of the Pentagon strategy, review demographic data, economic data, social data and achievements of the past.
* Third: The work, meaning, content must be examined in accordance with the general form of the Council of Jurists.
* Fourth: The work schedule to complete this policy is the end of 2024.
