The center was built with the help of the Thai government at a cost of more than $ 2.3 million. A shelter for victims of human trafficking and vulnerable groups in Poipet City was established on August 15, 2022.
The establishment of a center for victims of trafficking is a testament to the spirit of the two governments to join in the fight against human trafficking and labor trafficking. In particular, help people affected by this trafficking.
