Nearly 100 tour operators in Siem Reap jointly reduce prices from 10% to 50% to attract tourists
(Siem Reap): Nearly 100 tour operators in Siem Reap for 5 days have jointly reduced the price of their products and services from 10% to 50% to attract tourists and to celebrate the World Tourism Day. Rise in Siem Reap.
Philip Set Kao, President of the Siem Reap Tourism Club Association, told Fresh News that from September 26 to 30, 2023, out of nearly 100 tour operators, 90% discount on tourism products and services is hotels. Guesthouses, restaurants, massage parlors and spas, as well as some tourist communities.
He added that the discount is a movement to celebrate World Tourism Day and to attract tourists to visit Siem Reap, which for a while has been closed.
He added, "We hope to attract more national and foreign visitors to Cambodia, as well as more promotion to foreign tourists." This is the first time that World Tourism Day has been held in Siem Reap. "Next year we will have a bigger event and a 10% to 50% discount throughout September to celebrate World Tourism Day."
