For the First Time, Samdech Hun Manet Receives a Delegation of US Senate Officials Led by Alex Carnes National Congress of the United States Senate. The meeting took place at the Peace Palace on the evening of August 28, 2023 at the Peace Palace.
In the second meeting, Samdech Thabeti Hun Manet received Acting US Deputy Secretary of State Victoria Nolen. The meeting was held on September 22, 2023 in New York, USA, when the President addressed the United Nations General Assembly.
In the third meeting, Samdech Hun Sen met with US Ambassador to Cambodia Moufi. Held this morning, September 27, 2023 at the Peace Palace.
Not only did she welcome the new Royal Government and Prime Minister of Cambodia, she also announced the resumption of US $ 18 million a year in development assistance to Cambodia. Also. The grant was announced by the United States after the Cambodian election in July 2023 because the United States perceived that the election did not respect the principles of democracy.
In addition to the issues raised above, all meetings with senior US officials also discussed strengthening and enhancing relations and cooperation between Cambodia and the United States.
Through a series of short meetings between the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia and senior US officials can be a sign of positive development between Cambodia or not?
Cambodia and the United States officially began diplomatic relations on July 11, 1950. At the beginning of the relationship, the United States began providing assistance to Cambodia focusing on education and infrastructure, including the Khmer-American Friendship Road (National Road 4), which connects Phnom Penh to Sihanoukville, the only deep-sea port city. Of Cambodia.
However, this bilateral relationship was severed again after April 17, 1975, after the fall of Lon Nol's Republic and Cambodia was ruled by Democratic Kampuchea led by Pol Pot.
It was not until the early 1990s that relations between Cambodia and the United States resumed. The United States opened a mission on November 11, 1991, and was reassigned as an embassy in May 1994.
Since the resumption of relations in the early 1990s, relations between Cambodia and the United States have been steadily enhanced, and political, security, education, development and trade cooperation has been co-ordinated. In 2022, the trade volume between Cambodia and the United States reached more than 13 billion US dollars.
The relationship between Cambodia and the United States over the last 30 years can be considered as much better than in the past. Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the Prime Minister of Cambodia in 2022, has highlighted that there has never been a time when relations between Cambodia and the United States were as good as during the Second Kingdom of Cambodia. But Samdech Techo also raised the question that just wanting to be a good friend of the United States, why is it so difficult?
Cambodia-US relations have been improving since the 1990s, but compared to Cambodia-China relations, Cambodia-China relations seem to have progressed better than Cambodia-US relations.
The main issues that often create conflict between Cambodia and the United States are democracy, human rights, freedom of expression, and most recently, Ream Naval Base.
Can Cambodia and the United States break through these issues to reach better communication opportunities?
In particular, the issue of Ream Naval Base has been confirmed by the Royal Government of Cambodia in both the old and new legislatures, neutralizing the policy of neutralizing foreign troops based on Cambodian territory. The development of Ream Naval Base is only an expansion of Cambodia's defense capabilities. Therefore, these are not the reasons why Cambodia and the United States can not move closer to each other.
For this reason, it is clear that Cambodia is committed to counting all foreign friends, including the United States. But Cambodia also needs to maintain its independence, national sovereignty, without any foreign friends to violate its democracy and independence.
In conclusion, the relationship between Cambodia and the United States can lead to a honeymoon and sweetness at any time if the United States is really willing to build good relations with Cambodia, leading to the expansion of cooperation for the benefit of the nation and People of both countries. But the United States must also know that Cambodia is an independent, sovereign nation that can not use its power to order Cambodia to do this or that according to its political agenda.
By: Van Saray
Samdech Hun Manet and US Ambassador Agree to Accelerate Procedures for Receiving Cambodians Sending from the US and Facilitating the Search for US Soldiers' Remains (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet and US Ambassador to Vietnam Cambodia has agreed to expedite procedures to receive Cambodian citizens sent from the United States and to coordinate the search for the remains of American soldiers killed during the war.
This agreement was made during a meeting between Samdech Hun Manet and the US Ambassador at the Peace Palace on Wednesday morning, September 27, 2023.
According to a spokesman for the Prime Minister's Office, during the meeting, President Hun Manet welcomed the Ambassador and his colleagues and informed them of the good results achieved by the President and the Cambodian delegation from bilateral meetings in New York. . In particular, the bilateral meeting with Victoria Nuland, Acting Deputy Secretary of State for the United States.
In addition, the two sides also discussed and continued to operate in other areas of mutual interest.
The Prime Minister praised and highly appreciated the Cambodia-US bilateral cooperation in the past. The two sides also pledged to continue to work more closely with each other for the benefit of both countries.
DPM Hang Chuon Naron Holds a Workshop on "Implementing School Management Information Technology Towards Digital Education Revolution" in Kampong Cham
(Kampong Cham): Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, on the morning of September 27, 2023, presided over a workshop on "Implementing Information Management Systems in Schools Towards an Education Revolution." "Digital."
The event was attended by the leaders of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, relevant ministries, institutions of Kampong Cham Provincial Administration, Department of Education, Youth and Sports of Kampong Cham, Metfone and a total of 159 NGOs in Kampong Cham.
The purpose of this workshop is to provide an opportunity for policy makers, policy makers, local authorities and all stakeholders to understand the benefits of using SIS, review the progress and further direction of SIS implementation in the province. Kampong Cham.
In response to the implementation of the new strategy of the Royal Government, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has reformed the education system, focusing on improving the quality of education, which aims to build human capital with full potential through the introduction of various policies and strategies. The information and communication technology in the education sector has eight policies.
Deputy Prime Minister Hang Chuon Naron said that in order to make this policy run smoothly, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has set up a number of digital information systems, such as: education information management system, staff management program, school textbook distribution system, scholarship management system. Student information tracking system, school tracking system, SIS school information management system and library management system.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhay Rithi Sen, Minister of Rural Development, in the morning of September 27, 2023, led a delegation of the Ministry and technical officers of the Department of Rural Roads to meet with leaders and professional officers and inspect the laboratory of the Ministry of Rural Development. Located in Prey Sala Village, Sangkat Kakab, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
