General knowledge: Features of sculpture in Koh Ker style
(Phnom Penh): Khmer architectural art is divided into many styles, including Phnom Da style, Sambo style, Prey Kmen style, Kampong Preah style, Kulen style, Preah Ko style, Bakheng style, Koh Ker style, Transfiguration style, Banteay Srei style, Warehouse style, Baphuon style, Angkor Wat style, Bayon style, Modern style Central and so on.
The statue of Koh Ker style is large, fat, not very muscular, but has a large belly, square face, wide forehead, while the petals are in the form of long wings attached to the eyebrows and slightly curved at the end, and large round eyes. Double deck, similar to Bakheng style, big nose and slightly high, long earlobes, lips and chin, open shoulders, smiling face, adorned with mustache and beard growing around, usually around the neck of the statue has 4 folds.
"Connecting hearts, love for the future" is the motto of the 19th Asian Games in Hangzhou, China. This is also the first time that the Asian family has reunited with joy after the outbreak of Kovid-19, which has a deep meaning for strengthening the bonds of unity in Asia.
Asia is one of the seven largest and most populous continents in the world. The rich culture and civilization of Asia is a shining pearl that shines on. Despite the diversity of cultures and civilizations, countries and regions in Asia are constantly striving to find ways to increase mutual understanding in order to achieve harmonious coexistence.
In that, sports are an important bridge of friendship that connects the hearts of the people of different countries, especially bringing together athletes of all nationalities to come together to exchange experiences and compete in a peaceful and fun atmosphere, not to mention From politics, not to conflict, that is, the only common goal is to increase unity and brotherhood.
Article by: Tang Sileng, an employee of the Cambodia-China Friendship Radio, a representative of the Royal Government, briefed the Constitutional Council on the text of the law on the establishment of the Ministry of Inspection and the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Border Affairs.
(Phnom Penh): Representatives of the Royal Government on September 27, 2023 clarified to the Constitutional Council on the text of the law on the establishment of the Ministry of Inspection and the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Border Affairs, which has already been approved by the National Assembly.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Hy Sophea, Member of the Constitutional Council, on behalf of Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council. Representatives of the Royal Government briefed the Constitutional Council on the text of the Law on the Establishment of the Ministry of Inspection led by Minister of Inspection Huot Hak, while the Law on the Establishment of the Secretariat of State for Border Affairs led by Lam was the Minister in charge of the Secretariat for Border Affairs.
Please be informed that these two articles of law were approved by the National Assembly on September 14, 2023 in the first session of the 7th legislature and the Senate reviewed the unanimous opinion on the form and concept of the law without amendment in the Senate session. Extraordinary 4th legislature on September 21, 2023.
This invitation to the relevant parties is in accordance with the provisions of Article 21 of the Law on the Organization and Functioning of the Constitutional Council, which stipulates that, if necessary, the Constitutional Council has the right to request clarification or provide documents from Relevant ministries and institutions.
It should be noted that both draft laws were approved by the Council of Ministers at the plenary session of the Council of Ministers on September 24, 2023.
The Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection was established in 1999 with the aim of promoting and strengthening governance to ensure the efficiency, integrity, professionalism, professional discipline, discipline and cleanliness of public administration, as well as contributing to prevention, fight, reduction and elimination. Corruption.
The draft law on the establishment of the Ministry of Inspection is prepared in 10 articles.
The draft law on the establishment of the Secretariat of State for Border Affairs has been prepared in eight articles. Ministry of Labor provides allowances to garment workers whose contracts have been suspended (7th time)
