(Tbong Khmum): Before the Kan Ben-Pchum Ben festival is approaching, Senior Minister Prum Sokha and his family distributed gifts of clothes and some money to the poor people who live in the village with the fence. 7 Roka Khnor commune, Krouch Chhmar district, Tbong Khmum province.
