(Prey Veng): At least four people were killed, five others were injured and one was missing in a horrific accident caused by a negligent Samsung driver at 8:30 pm on the 24th. September 2023 at Kraing village, Theay commune, Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province.
Ba Phnom District Military Police said that the driver of a Samsung car named Yang Yorn, 39 years old, living in Kdei Dong village, Rong Damrey commune, Ba Phnom district, drove from east to west to the scene of the curve, causing the car to overturn. Entered the canal with 10 people in the car (4 dead, 5 injured and 1 missing).
Currently, the victim was sent to Ba Phnom District Referral Hospital, the body was handed over to the family to take to the traditional ceremony and the car to be stored at the administrative post in Theay commune.
According to the relatives of the victim, the victim was driving a Samsung car from a relative in Poun village, Teuk Thla commune, Svay Antor district, Prey Veng province. This is it.
